text: ["Artifact spells you cast have convoke. (Your creatures can help cast those spells. Each creature you tap while casting an artifact spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)", "Destroy all creatures you don't control and all planeswalkers you don't control.", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card unless target opponent sacrifices a creature or pays 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Resolute Archangel enters the battlefield, if your life total is less than your starting life total, it becomes equal to your starting life total.', 'Flying\\nWhen Siege Dragon enters the battlefield, destroy all Walls your opponents control.\\nWhenever Siege Dragon attacks, if defending player controls no Walls, it deals 2 damage to each creature without flying that player controls.', 'Other Goblin creatures you control attack each combat if able.\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token with haste.\\nWhenever Goblin Rabblemaster attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking Goblin.', "When Phytotitan dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner's control at the beginning of their next upkeep.", 'When Reclamation Sage enters the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'You may have Mercurial Pretender enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature you control, except it has "{2}{U}{U}: Return this creature to its owner\'s hand."']
flavor: ['"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', 'An eye for detail, a mind for numbers, a soul of clockwork.', 'Beyond pain, beyond obsession and wild despair, there lies a place of twisted power only the most tormented souls can reach.', 'Cut it down, bury it in snow, put it to the torch. The rose will still bloom again.', 'Its root system spans the entire floor of the jungle, making eradication impossible.', 'The king went off to find himself. Imagine his terror when he succeeded.', 'The promise of anguish is payment enough for services rendered.']
